  "historyNote": "#741, eff 1-18-76; amd by #1756, eff 5-26-81; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #5127, eff 4-29-91; ss by #5701, eff 9-17-93; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; amd by #6455, eff 2-19-97; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
